# Hand-placed, not tied to an opening: the colonnade's columns and the lamps beside the door,
# carried over unchanged from the old hand-built arch/villa_facade.part. The stylobate and
# architrave they stand on are real CAD geometry in villa.py now; only the kit pieces that dress
# that masonry -- which have no hole behind them for Walls.kit to track -- live here.

# front colonnade, -z: eight columns from the stylobate at y 0.5 to the architrave at y 5.1
piece models/own/arch/wall_column.obj   -8.400  0.500  -7.400   1.500 1.000 1.500   0.0 0.0 0.0   1.67 1.73 1.83  tex plaster_smooth 0.8
piece models/own/arch/wall_column.obj   -6.000  0.500  -7.400   1.500 1.000 1.500   0.0 0.0 0.0   1.67 1.73 1.83  tex plaster_smooth 0.8
